    { 4050, "Disguised as a mascara kit, this devious gadget quietly knocks out enemies for a short duration." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_1
    { 4051, "A traditional Japanese long sword. Silent and deadly. A well-timed swing may block projectiles such as shuriken and small caliber bullets." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_2
    { 4052, "A curved Indian sword. Useful for dispatching enemies quietly. Can also block small caliber bullets and certain other projectiles." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_3
    { 4053, "Japanese throwing stars are assassins' weapons. They're most effective against unsuspecting foes." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_4
    { 4054, "A thrown explosive device that can be lobbed over walls and around corners. Makes up in effectiveness what it lacks in subtlety." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_5
    { 4055, "A powerful explosive device cunningly disguised as an ordinary alley cat. Once its proximity fuse is activated, it will chase after its victims and explode." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_6
    { 4056, "A .32 caliber handgun. Reliable and effective. Can be fitted with a silencer." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_7
    { 4057, "This multi-purpose tool was designed to accommodate a large, cylindrical canister that can be fitted with various devices and forms of ammunition." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_8
    { 4058, "While not standard issue for spies, a combat shotgun can be useful in certain situations. Accommodates shells and various types of slug." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_9
    { 4064, "This fold-out micromissile launcher fits comfortably inside a woman's handbag, making it easy for an agent to carry and difficult for enemies to detect." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_15
    { 4065, "This miniature spy camera is hidden inside a functional lipstick. The camera has a limited depth of field, so you may have to zoom in for a clear shot." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_16
    { 4066, "An industrial strength explosive device ideally suited to sabotage." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_17
    { 4067, "This ordinary looking women's compact conceals a sophisticated decoding device used to read encrypted text and ascertain numerical codes for security devices." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_18
    { 4068, "This miniature welder uses aerosol hairspray as fuel, which makes it easy to disguise but not quite as effective as a regular welder." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_19
    { 4069, "What appears to be an ordinary toe nail clipper is actually a sophisticated lock pick." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_20
    { 4070, "When attached to a telephone, this electronic bug will record sound data. You must then activate the bug to hear both sides of the conversation." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_21
    { 4071, "This perfume bottle sprays a solution that quickly and conveniently disposes of bodies. Be sure to search for useful items before removing a target." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_22
    { 4072, "By throwing this coin, you can create disturbances to lure guards away from their posts." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_23
    { 4073, "You can leave bear traps lying around to snare enemies. Just don't step on one yourself." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_24
    { 4074, "The globe on this keychain is actually a small bulb that emits a faint glow." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_25
    { 4075, "Even an ordinary banana can be devastating in the right hands. Leave it where someone is likely to step on it." }, // IDS_WEAPON_DESC_26
