    { 11014, "That covers the basics." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11014
    { 11015, "Anything else?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11015
    { 11016, "The Equipment screen shows you a complete list of the weapons and gadgets you're carrying. Choosing an item from this list will bring up a detailed description and a summary of available ammunition types or gadget functions, which can also be selected here." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11016
    { 11017, "Jolly good. I'll be in touch soon." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11017
    { 11018, "Careful!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11018
    { 11019, "You can lean around corners to see what's up ahead." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11019
    { 11020, "Enemies will eventually notice you, though, so don't peek too long." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11020
    { 11021, "Enemies can hear any sound you make, so learn to move quietly." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11021
    { 11022, "Your footsteps can give you away, but you can Sneak to tread softly." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11022
    { 11023, "Keep in mind that certain materials, such as ceramic tile, magnify sound, whereas surfaces like grass or snow will dampen your footfalls." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11023
    { 11024, "Also, be careful not to knock over bottles or bump into wind chimes or you'll cause a disturbance." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11024
    { 11025, "Try to dispatch enemies when they're unsuspecting. If they see you, they'll cry out, attracting attention." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11025
    { 11026, "Also, don't leave bodies lying around. Move them somewhere out of the way." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11026
    { 11027, "When you overcome certain obstacles or accomplish specific objectives, you'll receive skill point rewards." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11027
    { 11040, "He can't. He's paralyzed. You have to be very careful with the dosage." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11040
    { 11056, "She caught me by surprise. She's fast for her age." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11056
    { 11057, "She must have been really mad." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11057
    { 11058, "She thinks we don't dress properly for ninjas. I'm like, Mom, it's the '60s. Get used to it. And she's like, It's disrespectful. So I said, old people always say that." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11058
    { 11059, "Uh oh." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11059
    { 11060, "Yeah, she went kind of crazy. She came flying across the room and started slashing at me. Finally I fought her off, but I was worried I was going to accidentally stab her. That would have made her really mad." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11060
    { 11061, "You better buy her some chocolates or something." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11061
    { 11062, "Good idea." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11062
    { 11063, "Agent Archer, over here!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11063
    { 11064, "I have bad news. They've moved the meeting. You'll have to find out where." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11064
    { 11065, "Look for places where ninjas are gathered together." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11065
    { 11066, "Maybe you can hear them talking about the new location." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11066
    { 11067, "You might be able to find a memo, but that's risky." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11067
    { 11068, "Be careful!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11068
    { 11069, "Why are they moving the meeting to the main house?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11069
    { 11070, "Isako-san says the Director wants it there." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11070
