    { 11072, "No, he'd just call for his palanquin." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11072
    { 11073, "I hate working for him." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11073
    { 11074, "We all do, but Isako-san owes him a debt of honor." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11074
    { 11075, "Good work! I'll mark the location of the meeting on this map." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11075
    { 11076, "Okay, follow me!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11076
