    { 11078, "It's safer to avoid them." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11078
    { 11079, "Avoid the main gate. Too many guards." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11079
    { 11080, "Good luck." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11080
    { 11081, "Any trouble?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11081
    { 11082, "It's been very quiet." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11082
    { 11083, "Good. " }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11083
    { 11084, "The spy has been spotted." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11084
    { 11085, "Stay alert." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11085
    { 11086, "I noticed she's been gaining a lot of weight recently." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11086
    { 11087, "All she does is sit around eating mochi and watching detective shows." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11087
    { 11088, "She needs to find a man to take care of her." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11088
    { 11089, "No one wants her. She's too shy. Maybe if she was prettier, but she can't even talk to men." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11089
    { 11090, "What about Kenichi's son? He's a little slow, but he's still nice looking." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11090
    { 11091, "She'd never agree. She's too picky." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11091
    { 11092, "What's wrong with her?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11092
    { 11093, "What time is it?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11093
    { 11094, "I don't know. Why?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11094
    { 11095, "I'm supposed to relieve Masayo-san at 8:00. You don't have a watch?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11095
    { 11096, "I don't need one. Ninjas can tell time by the slit of a cat's eye." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11096
    { 11097, "That only works during daylight. Besides, what happens if you don't have a cat handy?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11097
    { 11098, "That's why I always carry dried fish." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11098
    { 11099, "Isn't easier just to wear a watch? Never mind. I'll go ask somebody else." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11099
    { 11100, "It's such a nice evening. Too bad we have to work." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11100
    { 11104, "So?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11104
    { 11105, "I got in trouble last week. It's not worth it." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11105
    { 11106, "Find her!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11106
    { 11107, "Quickly!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11107
    { 11108, "Don't let her escape!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11108
    { 11109, "Search everywhere!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11109
    { 11110, "If she gets away, we're in big trouble!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11110
    { 11111, "She may come this way. Make sure she doesn't get by you!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11111
    { 11112, "Hai!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11112
    { 11120, "What do you mean? Why not?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11120
    { 11121, "Do you know how many forms you have to fill out to request office materials? It's worse than lavatory supplies. We don't need paper clips." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11121
    { 11122, "And when you run out of staples?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11122
    { 11123, "I can live without staples." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11123
    { 11124, "You disgust me." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11124
    { 11125, "It's colder than yesterday." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11125
    { 11126, "Just think, if we conquer America, Florida will be part of the Soviet Union. " }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11126
    { 11127, "Last year for holiday they sent me to Murmansk." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11127
    { 11128, "At least I got Minsk." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11128
    { 11129, "I dream of being sent to Minsk. I don't remember what it's like to go to bed without wearing a jacket." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11129
    { 11136, "I'm not sure. I didn't even think about it." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11136
    { 11137, "Well, I doubt anyone will notice. They don't read those things anyway. If they complain, we'll just resubmit." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11137
    { 11138, "You misunderstand me, Comrade. My point is that the State IS the People. When you abuse the People, you abuse the State." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11138
    { 11139, "But the State abuses the People all the time. What do you call that, masochism?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11139
    { 11140, "The State doesn't ABUSE the People, it GUIDES them." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11140
    { 11141, "My grandfather died at the hands of the Cheka. He was put in a barrel with rats. The 18 year old torturer who came up with the idea heated the barrel until the rats clawed their way inside my grandfather's body to escape the heat. Do you call that guidance?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11141
    { 11142, "Disciplinary measures are sometimes necessary to preserve the sanctity of the State. If an ugly tumor grows on your nose, you cut it off to protect your body." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11142
    { 11143, "My grandfather was a peasant. He died because he was afraid of collectivization." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11143
    { 11144, "The People must learn to trust the State." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11144
    { 11145, "I thought you said the People ARE the State." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11145
    { 11146, "Yes, which means they must learn to trust themselves." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11146
    { 11147, "My grandfather DID trust himself. That's why the State tortured and killed him." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11147
    { 11148, "I can see that your patriotism is in question, Comrade. Perhaps you should consider a visit to the Attitude Adjustment Center in Prague." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11148
    { 11149, "Those two are at it again." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11149
    { 11150, "Sergei never gives up, does he?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11150
    { 11151, "He's young and idealistic. Give him time." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11151
    { 11152, "This is Kominsky. We found a suspicious person at the old dacha by the lake. We're bringing him in for interrogation." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11152
    { 11153, "What were you doing there?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11153
    { 11154, "Vacation." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11154
    { 11155, "You must take me for a fool. No one would come to this place for vacation." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11155
    { 11156, "I come for hunting." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11156
    { 11157, "Admit it, you're a spy." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11157
    { 11158, "Why would I come here to spy?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11158
    { 11159, "Because you know that a top secret project is being worked on at this base." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11159
    { 11160, "It is?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11160
    { 11161, "Igor." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11161
    { 11162, "What?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11162
    { 11163, "You just told him about the project." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11163
    { 11164, "He tricked me!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11164
    { 11165, "How did I trick you?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11165
    { 11166, "You got me to tell you about Project: Omega." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11166
    { 11167, "Project: Omega?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11167
    { 11168, "Igor, you fool!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11168
    { 11169, "Damn it. This prisoner is too devious. We'd better torture him." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11169
    { 11170, "Thank you for helping me." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11170
    { 11171, "I'm going to sample their vodka before I go back." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11171
