    { 11173, "Don't you have work to do?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11173
    { 11174, "Complete mission so we can get out of here." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11174
    { 11175, "I hate Siberia." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11175
    { 11176, "People have been exiled to Siberia since time of Genghis Khan." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11176
    { 11177, "Siberians make good butter, though." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11177
    { 11178, "Also, Lake Baikal is very beautiful in summertime." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11178
    { 11179, "Did you know it's largest body of fresh water in whole world?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11179
