    { 11708, "That morale officer is a serious liability." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11708
    { 11709, "Aw, come on, she's not that bad." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11709
    { 11710, "How am I supposed to feel intimidating in a pink uniform? And what kind of self respecting evil organization has a slogan like: Good at being bad. Bad at being good?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11710
    { 11711, "I kind of like it. Besides, it got shot down anyway." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11711
    { 11712, "That's not my point. It never should have been proposed in the first place. Where's the menace?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11712
    { 11713, "Give her a break. This is her first time in a criminal organization. She used to work at a breakfast cereal company." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11713
    { 11714, "Good Lord!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11714
    { 11715, "What can I do for you?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11715
    { 11728, "I'm busy." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11728
    { 11729, "Come back later. This could take a while." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11729
    { 11730, "Please, give me privacy!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11730
    { 11731, "Thank you for rescuing me. I'll go back to dacha. I can follow road if you open gate." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11731
    { 11732, "Let me know when coast is clear." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11732
    { 11733, "Here I go!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11733
    { 11734, "Tell me when it's safe." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11734
    { 11735, "I'm going!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11735
    { 11736, "Tell me when." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11736
    { 11737, "Cover me!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11737
    { 11738, "Gate is locked! Open it!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11738
    { 11739, "Don't leave me here! They'll torture me!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11739
    { 11740, "Thank you! I'll wait at dacha." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11740
    { 11741, "That's the communications relay tower above you on your right. " }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11741
    { 11742, "Refer to your map to keep from getting lost." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11742
    { 11743, "Commandeer a snowmobile and get back to the plane! Hurry!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11743
    { 11744, "Bad news! H.A.R.M. agents arrived before you. They're going to blow up the plane! Your pilot is hiding, but you're in trouble if they find him." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11744
    { 11745, "The main road has been cut off! You'll have to find another way out of the area!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11745
    { 11746, "It's a safe bet the police will be looking for you now that they think you killed Kamal's associate. Stay out of their way." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11746
    { 11760, "So did I! That's why I was looking back." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11760
    { 11761, "Likely story! Why would a monkey chase YOU?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11761
    { 11762, "Sometimes they smell my bananas. Last week a mob of them attacked me. They stole half my stock!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11762
    { 11763, "They're always after my mangoes too." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11763
    { 11776, "He's trying to block the street!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11776
    { 11777, "Hurry! He's closing the gates!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11777
    { 11778, "Shoot the lock on that gate!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11778
    { 11779, "Hurry and shoot that lock!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11779
    { 11780, "I'm feeling a bit winded." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11780
    { 11781, "We're gaining on him!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11781
    { 11782, "Up on that balcony!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11782
    { 11783, "Hold tight! Sharp turn dead ahead!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11783
    { 11784, "Don't expect me to hold your purse for you this time." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11784
    { 11785, "Help me! The gate is locked! There's nowhere to run!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11785
    { 11786, "Run for your life! It's right behind me!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11786
    { 11787, "Bring more water!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11787
    { 11788, "Hurry! The ice cream is melting!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11788
    { 11789, "It's no use! The fire is out of control!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11789
    { 11790, "Help me, someone!!!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11790
    { 11791, "I'm in big trouble!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11791
    { 11792, "Agent Archer! Over here!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11792
    { 11793, "He's going to kill me!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11793
    { 11794, "You seen Carter lately?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11794
    { 11795, "Didn't you hear? They caught him trying to arrange an interview with Vengeance Factory. He had the plans for Project Epsilon in his portfolio.  So they turned him into a Man-Crate." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11795
    { 11796, "Jeez. Serves him right. That's the problem with this industry. Criminals just have too many entitlement issues to put the TEAM first." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11796
    { 11797, "Cornelius Fitchpins, Ensign Third Class." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11797
    { 11808, "Ow! Stop it!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11808
    { 11809, "Get off! You're smashing me!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11809
    { 11810, "Welcome to the Man-Handler, H.A.R.M.'s latest all-purpose death trap and automated torture device. Let's take a look at what today's victim has in store, shall we?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11810
    { 11811, "Man-Crate! That's right, folks, the victim is about to become a living block of human misery. The perfect punishment for all those naughty boys and girls who need a reminder of how completely and utterly insignificant they are. The procedure is even 65 percent reversible, which means you can reward your Man-Crates for good behavior by turning them into pale, quivering shadows of their former selves!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11811
    { 11812, "Heat up the griddle and get your spatulas ready! We're making Man-Cakes!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11812
    { 11813, "How about a bowl of chunky Manhattan-style Man-Chowder!?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11813
    { 11814, "Mama mia! It looks like today's victim is in for MAXIMUM PUNISHMENT! Get ready for the main course, ladies and gentlemen! We're having spaghetti with Man-Sauce!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11814
    { 11824, "Sure did. You like it?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11824
    { 11825, "Heck, yeah. It's pretty damn spiffy compared to that crap we used to have." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11825
    { 11826, "It can handle temperatures up to 343 kelvins. The previous substance deconstituted at around 313 kelvins. I take baths hotter than that." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11826
    { 11827, "The only problem is it doesn't really look like lava." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11827
    { 11828, "That's actually by design. Our first few prototypes were very naturalistic, but the focus group results weren't where they needed to be. So we said hell with it. Let's just concentrate on making it look cool." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11828
    { 11829, "What was wrong with the realistic stuff?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11829
    { 11830, "People take reality for granted, so it's hard to impress them with your garden variety liquid magma. Why do you think we have our headquarters in underground caverns? It'd be a lot cheaper and more convenient to lease an office building, but then you get potential clients who don't think you're evil enough for the really high profile operations." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11830
    { 11831, "Makes a lot of sense." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11831
    { 11832, "Take a look at the latest Criminality Monthly. They profile two evil organizations: Misery, Incorporated and Fist of Injustice. If you look at their CVs..." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11832
    { 11833, "What's a CV?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11833
    { 11834, "Curriculum vitae. Like a resume. Anyway, Misery, Inc. is a way more sophisticated outfit. Fist of Injustice is strictly third rate: kidnappings, extortion, the petty kind of stuff any guy with a two car garage and a mental disorder can pull off. But they've got a much better rep in the criminal industry." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11834
    { 11835, "No kidding. I thought they were pretty much on par with us." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11835
    { 11836, "We've got more evil in our daycare center than they have in their entire organization. But they hired a top rate design firm to help them with their lair." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11836
    { 11837, "Is that the place that's sort of a science fiction medieval dungeon kind of thing? " }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11837
    { 11838, "That's the one. I'll bet it's all held together by strings and chewing gum, but it sure impresses the media." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11838
    { 11839, "Look for caches of Anti Super Soldier Serum! You'll need the serum to get rid of the invasion force!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11839
    { 11841, "So what happened, anyway? I thought you were going to guard the flag." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11841
    { 11842, "Don't even start, girlie." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11842
    { 11843, "I single-handedly fought off a super soldier invasion and you couldn't even handle one little self-infatuated sissy with a target pistol." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11843
    { 11844, "He took me by surprise!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11844
    { 11845, "Maybe you would have heard him coming if you didn't have your head up your arse." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11845
    { 11846, "Have some sympathy! I was shot! Multiple times!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11846
    { 11847, "Oh, poor baby." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11847
    { 11848, "Don't you mock me, woman. It stings!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11848
    { 11849, "Is that so? Well, I was zapped by a laser beam. You do you think THAT feels? Of course, after being impaled on a sword and carried off by a tornado, it's really not so bad." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11849
    { 11850, "You're lucky I'm bleeding to death or I'd teach you a thing or two about respect." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11850
    { 11851, "Bleeding to death?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11851
    { 11852, "All right, maybe that's a slight exaggeration." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11852
    { 11853, "Not that it makes a difference. I'll take you on any time, anywhere." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11853
    { 11854, "I'll tell you what the password is. It's... Balaji Malpani better shape up or he's going to die a very slow, painful death. Got that!?! Good BYE!!!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11854
    { 11855, "Head through this gate! It leads out to the street!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11855
    { 11856, "I'm on my coffee break. Come back later." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11856
    { 11857, "The helicopter's on its way! You'll have to hold out until it arrives. We think enemy reinforcements are closing in on your position, so brace yourself for a fight!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11857
    { 11858, "It's too late to rescue Armstrong. Find out where they're taking him!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11858
