    { 11878, "You mean a kilt?" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11878
    { 11879, "I don't know much about women's fashion. Anyway, the girl looked European with brown hair, an orange shirt, and striped pants. She was the one with the gun." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11879
    { 11880, "But the victim was stabbed." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11880
    { 11881, "Just arrest them. We'll sort out the details later." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11881
    { 11888, "I'm told a family was mauled by wild dogs at the Hotel Happy Guest. How tragic!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11888
    { 11889, "I wish those gangsters had taken over a different movie theater. This one had such comfortable seats." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11889
    { 11890, "You, there. I bring word from Kamal. He wants to meet you." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11890
    { 11891, "Sadly, I forgot where I saw him. You'll have to find him yourself." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11891
    { 11892, "Like you, I am a victim of injustice. I have been driven away from my precious gate by nasty policemen." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11892
    { 11893, "I realize you must find me irresistible, but I'm tired of talking to you." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11893
    { 11894, "Go away." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11894
    { 11895, "The acting was terrible! And the special effects? The blood looked like red paint!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11895
    { 11896, "It was arterial spray. It's brighter because it contains more oxygen. And how can you criticize the acting considering the movies YOU like?! I give up." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11896
    { 11897, "My favorite part is where she starts to undress and then the truck drives through the wall. I was laughing so hard soda shot out of my nose." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11897
    { 11898, "I like the scene in the bar with the guy with the thing and the other guy with the eye patch? I thought I was going to have to be hospitalized from laughing too much. What a great movie." }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11898
    { 11899, "Put out this fire!" }, // IDS_DIALOGUE_11899
