    { 25060, "<INTELLIGENCE ITEMS C02S02>" }, // IDS_INTEL_25060
    { 25061, "Ninja Clan Memo: Alert@All clan members should be on full alert! The spy is still at large! Set up roadblocks along the eastern and southern approaches!\n\nDo not let her escape!\n\nHaruko Muroi\nAssistant Administrator" }, // IDS_INTEL_25061
    { 25062, "Ninja Clan Memo: The spy@ATTENTION ALL CLAN MEMBERS\n\nI want the spy to die honorably and quickly. The Director and his soulless minion shall get no satisfaction from her death.\n\nIsako" }, // IDS_INTEL_25062
    { 25063, "Note: Emiko Late@Emiko,\n\nWhere are you? The alarm has sounded and everyone must report to their posts. If you get this note, hurry over before Isako-san notices you are missing!\n\nYukiko" }, // IDS_INTEL_25063
    { 25064, "Spy Manual@SPY TRAINING MANUAL" }, // IDS_INTEL_25064
    { 25065, "Ninja Clan Memo: Cate Archer@ATTENTION ALL CLAN MEMBERS\n\nThe target of tonight's operation is Cate Archer, British superspy. Do not underestimate her.\n\nOh, and make sure she suffers.\n\nThe Director" }, // IDS_INTEL_25065
