    { 25281, "Soviet Memo: Recent explosions@To: Maintenance Division\nFrom: Sergeant Butsenko\n\nI have continually warned others of the hazards of storing fuel in open areas. The recent series of explosions has confirmed my views. I suggest a Fuel Committee be started to evaluate the problem and document the solution." }, // IDS_INTEL_25281
