    { 25341, "Letter: Dear Mother@Dear Mother,\n\nHow are you? It has been long time, yes? How is Cincinnati? I am big time pilot now. Today I flew to Siberia on secret mission. Job is dangerous, but I get paid good money. You are getting checks, yes? It makes me happy.\n\nLove,\nMisha" }, // IDS_INTEL_25341
