    { 25808, "H.A.R.M. Memo: CT-180@To: Commander Pim\nFrom: Crewman Miller\n\nI am unable to finish my analysis of the UNITY CT-180. I seem to have glued the ammo casing to my desk. Maintenance has been notified and I hope to be up and running again by tomorrow." }, // IDS_INTEL_25808
    { 25809, "H.A.R.M. Memo: Magnus Armstrong@To: Security\nFrom: Commander Pim\n\nThe Director will be arriving later today. He'll probably want to gloat over Armstrong, so make sure to have a security detail standing by. We don't want any unfortunate accidents." }, // IDS_INTEL_25809
