    { 25941, "H.A.R.M. Memo: Assassins@To: Dmitrij Volkov\nFrom: The Director\n\nWell, your mime solution was every bit as much of a fiasco as I predicted. Not that Isako was any better. I'm starting to question her value to the organization. We should have brought in the Australian." }, // IDS_INTEL_25941
