    { 26201, "Letter: Apartment keys@Dearest Phoolwati,\n\nI pray to blessed Kaamdhenu Vidya, the sacred cow, that you will meet me again. I left the keys to the apartment in the usual place. How I am longing to see you!\n\nLove, Balaji\n" }, // IDS_INTEL_26201
    { 26202, "Letter: Flowers@Balaji dear,\n\nHow I have missed you, my sweet! Will you meet me later at my apartment? I'm cooking lamb tika masala with mint chutney.\n\nPhoolwati\n\nP.S. Please don't pick flowers for me from my planter box downstairs. I appreciate the sentiment, but my lovely white carnations won't flourish if they're constantly molested.\n" }, // IDS_INTEL_26202
